<title>ROMANIA: SOCCER-GLORIA BISTRITA AND FIORENTINA DREW 1-1 IN EURO CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GLORIA BISTRITA AND FIORENTINA DREW 1-1 IN EURO CUP.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gloria Bistrita (Romania) and Fiorentina of Italy drew 1-1 (halftime 1-0) in the first leg, first round of European Cup Winnners Cup competition played in Bistrita on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Gloria Bistrita - Ilie Lazar (3rd)</p>
<p>Fiorentina - Gabriel Omar Batistuta (53rd)</p>
<p>Attendance: 10,000</p>
